  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA SUPPLIES PROGRAM YEAR 2 CONTRIBUTION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNFPA Supplies Partnership is a thematic fund that facilitates expanded access to high quality contraceptives and medicines used for maternal health. It operates in 54 countries globally, in Africa, Asia, the Pacific and Latin America. The partnership operates in all Vote 27 priority countries, with the exception of Vietnam. Several crisis-affected countries are also included in the partnership, e.g. Afghanistan, Somalia, and Yemen. While a number of non ODA specific but otherwise strategic counties for DFA are included e.g. Nigeria and Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
